{"2949910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ANGST: A TALE OF SURVIVAL", "steam_appid": 2949910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ANGST is a dark quest-driven survival game set in the frozen, mysterious world known as The Hollow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/a66789607531afdf294ac7afa19ab9eb.poster.avif?t=1787927286\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/a66789607531afdf294ac7afa19ab9eb.webm?t=1787927286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/a66789607531afdf294ac7afa19ab9eb.mp4?t=1787927286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You wake up in a small cabin, surrounded by a vast, ice-bound wilderness. Suddenly, a mysterious voice breaks through the radio. You don’t know if it’s a friend or an enemy… but you have no choice. Only this voice can help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During the day, prepare yourself: gather resources, craft tools and weapons. At night, deadly beasts and strange entities emerge. Some will guide you further; others will begin the hunt. It’s time to step into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/b75b503b179764a114f1746881753c3a.poster.avif?t=1787927286\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/b75b503b179764a114f1746881753c3a.webm?t=1787927286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover the secrets of The Hollow by completing quests that reveal the forgotten history of the land and the truth about who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/8701509739a31857a687cca8fc8cc0e8.poster.avif?t=1787927286\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/8701509739a31857a687cca8fc8cc0e8.webm?t=1787927286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore forests, frozen rivers, and abandoned structures. Search deserted cabins, fish through the ice, and set traps for wildlife. Remember: the deeper you venture, the more dangerous it becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival in the frost: </strong>prepare during the day by gathering and crafting; face deadly creatures at night.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey through The Hollow: </strong>help wandering souls whose quests uncover the past - and your place in the present.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust no one:</strong> some will help you, others will hunt you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful choices: </strong>gain experience and decide which skills to learn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt: </strong>upgrade your character, develop abilities, and refine your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight to survive: </strong>loot abandoned sites, fish under the ice, chop wood, and hunt wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense, dynamic survival:</strong> every sound could mean danger. In The Hollow, nothing is what it seems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ANGST is a dark quest-driven survival game set in the frozen, mysterious world known as The Hollow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/a66789607531afdf294ac7afa19ab9eb.poster.avif?t=1787927286\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/a66789607531afdf294ac7afa19ab9eb.webm?t=1787927286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/extras/a66789607531afdf294ac7afa19ab9eb.mp4?t=1787927286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You wake up in a small cabin, surrounded by a vast, ice-bound wilderness. Suddenly, a mysterious voice breaks through the radio. You don’t know if it’s a friend or an enemy… but you have no choice. Only this voice can help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During the day, prepare yourself: gather resources, craft tools and weapons. At night, deadly beasts and strange entities emerge. Some will guide you further; others will begin the hunt. It’s time to step into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" pos