xperience and decide which skills to learn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt: </strong>upgrade your character, develop abilities, and refine your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight to survive: </strong>loot abandoned sites, fish under the ice, chop wood, and hunt wildlife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense, dynamic survival:</strong> every sound could mean danger. In The Hollow, nothing is what it seems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Explore a frozen, mysterious land in this top-down survival adventure. Gather resources, craft tools, and fight to stay alive as you uncover a story of memory and redemption. Try to escape The Hollow.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Russian, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish, Japanese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/0a64a2aa3e301fbbf06920fe5d3799e64b7eb195/header.jpg?t=1787927286", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/7f6cb6a23ccbad6aaaa7e74326aa2f5790efbcaf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787927286", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949910/7f6cb6a23ccbad6aaaa7e74326aa2f5790efbcaf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787927286", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> WINDOWS® 10, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i3 6th Gen or AMD FX™-8800P<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® 920MX or AMD Radeon™ 625<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Addi